---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About Us - Team Vyoma" description="Learn about Team Vyoma's journey, mission, and achievements in aerospace engineering and aeromodelling.">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero" style="min-height: 60vh;">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <h1>About Team Vyoma</h1>
            <p>Pioneering aerospace innovation since 2007</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Mission Section -->
    <section class="section">
        <div class="section-header">
            <h2 class="section-title">Our Mission</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">
                To develop state-of-the-art technologies in autonomous robotics and accelerate 
                the growth of the aerospace domain through innovation and education
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="cards-grid">
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-icon">
                    <i class="fas fa-rocket"></i>
                </div>
                <h3>Research & Development</h3>
                <p>Conducting cutting-edge research in unmanned aerial vehicles and autonomous systems to push the boundaries of aerospace technology.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-icon">
                    <i class="fas fa-graduation-cap"></i>
                </div>
                <h3>Education & Outreach</h3>
                <p>Inspiring young minds through workshops, competitions, and educational programs to foster the next generation of aerospace engineers.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-icon">
                    <i class="fas fa-globe"></i>
                </div>
                <h3>Global Impact</h3>
                <p>Representing India in international competitions and collaborating with global institutions to advance aerospace technology worldwide.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- History Section -->
    <section class="section" style="background: white;">
        <div class="section-header">
            <h2 class="section-title">Our Journey</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">
                From humble beginnings to international recognition - the story of Team Vyoma
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
            <div class="card" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
                <h3 style="color: var(--primary-blue); margin-bottom: 1rem;">2007 - The Beginning</h3>
                <p>Team Vyoma was founded by seven passionate students with a vision to excel in aerospace engineering. Our journey began with a simple dream - to build aircraft that could compete on the world stage.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="card" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
                <h3 style="color: var(--primary-blue); margin-bottom: 1rem;">2008-2009 - First International Success</h3>
                <p>Our breakthrough came when we participated in the SAE Aero Design competition in the USA. Vyoma-I achieved 18th place out of 40 international teams, marking India's entry into competitive aeromodelling.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="card" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
                <h3 style="color: var(--primary-blue); margin-bottom: 1rem;">2013 - NASA Recognition</h3>
                <p>A milestone year when we won the prestigious NASA Systems Engineering Award at SAE Aero Design West, competing against 75 teams from around the world. This achievement put us on the global aerospace map.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="card" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
                <h3 style="color: var(--primary-blue); margin-bottom: 1rem;">2015 - AIAA DBF Pioneers</h3>
                <p>We became the first Indian team to successfully take off at an AIAA Design/Build/Fly event in Tucson, Arizona. Our autonomous vehicle V.E.N.G.E.A.N.C.E. secured 4th place at the Sparkfun AVC in Colorado.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="card">
                <h3 style="color: var(--primary-blue); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Present Day - Continued Excellence</h3>
                <p>Today, we continue to push boundaries in aerospace technology, participating in international competitions, conducting research, and inspiring the next generation of engineers through our outreach programs.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Video Section -->
    <section class="section" style="background: var(--light-gray);">
        <div class="section-header">
            <h2 class="section-title">See Us in Action</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">
                Watch our aircraft in flight and learn about our engineering process
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(400px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem; max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto;">
            <div class="card" style="padding: 0; overflow: hidden;">
                <iframe
                    style="width: 100%; height: 300px; border: none;"
                    src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/fvLBWQWJb3s"
                    title="Team Vyoma Aircraft Flight"
                    allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
                    allowfullscreen>
                </iframe>
                <div style="padding: 1.5rem;">
                    <h3>Vyoma Aircraft Flight Test</h3>
                    <p>Watch our latest aircraft design in action during flight testing.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="card" style="padding: 0; overflow: hidden;">
                <iframe
                    style="width: 100%; height: 300px; border: none;"
                    src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/OCySn5WkKhQ"
                    title="Team Vyoma Engineering Process"
                    allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
                    allowfullscreen>
                </iframe>
                <div style="padding: 1.5rem;">
                    <h3>Engineering Excellence</h3>
                    <p>Behind the scenes look at our design and manufacturing process.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Values Section -->
    <section class="section" style="background: var(--dark-navy); color: white;">
        <div class="section-header">
            <h2 class="section-title" style="color: white;">Our Values</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle" style="color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);">
                The principles that guide everything we do
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="cards-grid">
            <div class="card" style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);">
                <div class="card-icon" style="background: var(--accent-orange);">
                    <i class="fas fa-cogs"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 style="color: white;">Innovation</h3>
                <p style="color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);">Constantly pushing the boundaries of what's possible in aerospace technology and design.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="card" style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);">
                <div class="card-icon" style="background: var(--secondary-blue);">
                    <i class="fas fa-handshake"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 style="color: white;">Collaboration</h3>
                <p style="color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);">Working together as a team to achieve goals that no individual could accomplish alone.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="card" style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);">
                <div class="card-icon" style="background: var(--accent-orange);">
                    <i class="fas fa-star"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 style="color: white;">Excellence</h3>
                <p style="color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);">Maintaining the highest standards in everything we do, from design to execution.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>